              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gay"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My Mother made this all the time, especially at Christmas with 1/2 of a cherry on each piece she cut. And at Easter with a jelly bean on top. I love this stuff. Her recipe is a little different but basically the same.",
            "datePublished": "2012-03-04T15:56:18.740Z"
